   "heading": {
    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. These Regulations are the Credit Bureau (Composition of Offences) Regulations 2021 and come into operation on 31 May 2021."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H908-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Compoundable offences"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. The following offences (other than a continuing offence) may be compounded by the Authority in accordance with section 66 of the Act:\n(a)an offence under section 9(2), 13(8), 21(5), 33(9) or 37(5) of the Act;\n(b)an offence under the Act that is punishable by a fine only."
   }
